#: ../../task_manager.rst:2
msgid "Task Manager"
msgstr ""

#: ../../task_manager.rst:4
msgid "Access the **Task Manager** from the side menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../task_manager.rst:8
msgid "If some tasks are pending, the list will be shown in the Task Manager. Tap on the **Refresh** (1) button to update the task list and the **Delete** (2) to delete all tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../task_manager.rst:12
msgid "Any individual task can be deleted by pressing the delete button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../task_manager.rst:16
msgid "A task that is displayed as a green running image means that it is currently being executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../task_manager.rst:20
msgid "Once all tasks are completed, the **No Tasks Found** page is displayed."
msgstr ""
